  "name": "Enhance Code II",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Acquired with CR 11 or higher. During this Main Process, you gain a +[SRx5] bonus to [Magic Attack] damage rolls.</p>\n<p>(CR21): Increase bonus to +[SRx7].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A feat that increases the power of the spell cast immediately after using a spell that increases magical power. By putting the intention of a deadly death into words, the demonic blow gains unparalleled destructive power.</p>",
